      "prov:value": "**The narrative-asserts-code axis.** Whether prose asserts what an artefact\nactually does is a different question, currently answered only for Lean\n(`proof-narrative-lean-equiv`, beans `nrv8` and `qusg`).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
